  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Equity, Access and Quality in Education 2 (SEAQE2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learners  in Kapoeta state will access, engage and learn in inclusive primary schools. SEAQE2SS will develop education pathways for conflict affected children, out-of-school children and children with disabilities to access quality, relevant and inclusive education.</narrative>
  </description>
